    "Notebook" -> "974e939a-7268-4f58-b7f9-95898cc3d9dd"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> ".md\nHere, we scale them by eye so that the height above sea \
level only slightly \"modulates\" the sphere\[CloseCurlyQuote]s surface. This \
way, we get a visible relief of the Earth", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "8fb30c0c-79d8-4b06-a5e9-f1b443168d09", "Invisible" -> False, 
