   <|"Data" -> ".md\nThe result is stored in `vertices`. By default, the \
library generates an unindexed set of triangle vertices. This means we can \
directly interpret them as \n", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "91224c17-44f3-49c0-9e30-b337b8a681b4", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
