   <|"Data" -> "The result is stored in `vertices`. By default, the library \
generates an unindexed set of triangle vertices. This means we can directly \
interpret them as \n", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "18d754a3-cc59-4606-aeaf-503f376e12b1", "Invisible" -> False, 
