   <|"Data" -> ".md\nWhere none of the vertices are reused by another \
triangle. This format is especially simple for the GPU, as only one such list \
needs to be sent to one of the WebGL buffers. Fortunately, the `Polygon` \
primitive supports this format", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "f73c6b47-14ff-41ab-a679-0b5e85c59450", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
