    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "974e939a-7268-4f58-b7f9-95898cc3d9dd"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "Where none of the vertices are reused by another triangle. \
This format is especially simple for the GPU, as only one such list needs to \
be sent to one of the WebGL buffers. Fortunately, the `Polygon` primitive \
supports this format", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "0144fc76-6576-4c11-825b-a6466a438548", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
